Hello baby! kakatapos kolang mag review ng onti and before ako mag sleep, gusto kong gamitin tong time nato para i-share sayo yung thought's ko after hearing everything you felt, and I realized so many things about myself, specially about us. 

nasasaktan ako. It hurts because I never expected we’d get to this point, kasi ang akala ko nalapagpasan na natin tong phase nato? nahihirapan na ako pero gusto ko talagang mag work to kaya iniisip kong kaya pa natin to.

alam kong nahihirapan and exhausted kana sa relasyong to but sana maka hanap ka ng reason to stay? na sana we can still hold on and fight through this together. konting patience pa baby:<

I'm sorry if nawawala na naman ako. I’m sorry for leaving you during the times you needed me most. I’m sorry for being weak and for doing nothing when you needed someone to catch you. I'm sorry if madalas ako yung dahilan kung bakit nag stick kaparin sa pain and trauma mo before. I'm sorry if nag kulang ako. I’m sorry if I didn’t even try hard enough to find a reason to stay every time na magulo tayo. walang excuse na reason sa mga decisions kong nasasaktan ka kaya I just want you to know how truly sorry I am baby🥲
